# The shared lines, Phase 8 session 3 (Docs/Design/84 §33, §14.1's thin topics): one's own news (talk.news), 43
# openers before this phase. The openers carry the concept (§33.1); none hands on, so they're answered by what answers
# tell.news (session 1's react.news by kind, the move lines below, ask.detail, advice).
#
# The facts (Core/RatwAmbient.cpp World::ambientTopic, noteNews, victimNews): topic.kind is marriage, loss, work or
# crime; topic.news is the teller's own news in their own person: "I married Orm Ashdown", "I lost Bran Tarford", "I
# became apprentice to Hild Smith", "I took Wren on as an apprentice", "I took over the work of Bran Tarford",
# "someone robbed me", "a stranger attacked me", "I took Orm Blackwood to the gaol for the Watch". Never told to the
# one it's about.
#
# The rules they keep: the teller's own state by their own facts (self.married, self.mourning, self.apprentice,
# self.master, self.robbed, self.injured, the guard's job); nothing of the lost one's sex, age or kin (#topic.news#
# names them; no pronoun is known), nothing of a thief the news doesn't name; grief is quiet, never jaunty (§8.11);
# who says it by the grammar, what about by the criteria.

## ================================================================ Married

rule s83w_wed_1
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say I've news. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. I still can't quite believe it. | You'll hear it anyway, so: #topic.news#.

rule s83w_wed_2
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. I'm still getting used to saying it. | Guess what. #topic.news#. | Well, it's done. #topic.news#.

rule s83w_wed_3
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. Don't laugh. | Good news, for once. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. I'm the happiest wolf in #here.town#.

rule s83w_wed_4
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say I wanted you to hear it from me. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. I keep smiling at nothing. | #topic.news#. Somebody pinch me.

rule s83w_wed_friends
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage pair.band=friends
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say I've been dying to tell you. #topic.news#! | You first, before anyone. #topic.news#. | Sit down. #topic.news#. Stop grinning.

rule s83w_wed_family
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage pair.band=family
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Don't tell the rest of the family I told you first. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. You'll have a new one at the table. | #topic.news#. Be nice at supper.

rule s83w_wed_strangers
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage pair.band=strangers|acquaintances
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Forgive me, I'm telling everyone. #topic.news#. | You don't know me, but I can't keep it in. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. Sorry. I'm grinning at strangers today.

rule s83w_wed_old
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage self.stage=old
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say At my age! #topic.news#. | Never too late, they say. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. Old bones, young heart.

rule s83w_wed_shy
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage self.talk=quiet
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. | Mm. #topic.news#. That's my news. | I don't say much, but: #topic.news#.

rule s83w_wed_tavern
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage here.place=tavern
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Drink with me. #topic.news#. | This one's on me. #topic.news#. | Raise your cup. #topic.news#.

rule s83w_wed_work
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage here.place=work|market
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say I can't keep my mind on work. #topic.news#. | Before we start: #topic.news#. | I'll be useless today. #topic.news#.

rule s83w_wed_chapel
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage here.place=chapel
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Where better to say it? #topic.news#. | I came to give thanks. #topic.news#. | The Bright One heard me. #topic.news#.

rule s83w_wed_poor
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say No feast, no fine clothes. But #topic.news#. | We've nothing, but we've each other. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. Two can go hungry as cheap as one, they say.

rule s83w_wed_rich
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage self.wealth=rich
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say You'll have heard, I suppose. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. The seating plan nearly ended it. | #topic.news#. The whole family is beside itself.

## ================================================================ A loss

rule s83w_loss_1
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. | I've had bad news. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. I keep forgetting, and then remembering.

rule s83w_loss_2
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say You'll have heard. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. I don't know what to do with the days. | #topic.news#. Everything's very quiet.

rule s83w_loss_3
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say I have to say it out loud to someone. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. It doesn't feel real yet. | #topic.news#. I'm managing. Mostly.

rule s83w_loss_4
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. I'm all right. I'm not, but I am. | It's been a hard week. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. I keep setting out too many cups.

rule s83w_loss_kin
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss self.mourning=kin
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say We've had a death in the family. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. The house is too big now. | #topic.news#. Family's all that matters, and now there's less of it.

rule s83w_loss_friend
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss self.mourning=friend
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. A good friend. The best. | I've lost a friend. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. We'd known each other for years.

rule s83w_loss_friends
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss pair.band=friends|family|spouses
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say I didn't want to say it in front of the others. #topic.news#. | You're the only one I can say it to. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. Stay a while, will you?

rule s83w_loss_strangers
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss pair.band=strangers|acquaintances
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say Forgive me. #topic.news#. I needed to say it to someone. | You don't know me. But #topic.news#. | Sorry. #topic.news#. It's been on my mind all day.

rule s83w_loss_old
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss self.stage=old
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. At my age you bury more than you'd like. | #topic.news#. Another one gone ahead of me. | #topic.news#. I've lost count of the funerals. I hate that.

rule s83w_loss_young
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss self.stage=young|adolescent
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. Everyone at home is crying. | #topic.news#. I don't understand it. | #topic.news#. I'm trying to be brave.

rule s83w_loss_work
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss here.place=work|market
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say I came to work to keep busy. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. Work helps. A little. | Don't mind me today. #topic.news#.

rule s83w_loss_chapel
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss here.place=chapel
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say I came to sit for a while. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. I lit a candle. | #topic.news#. It's quiet here. I needed quiet.

rule s83w_loss_tavern
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss here.place=tavern
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say One cup, for remembering. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. I didn't want to be at home #tonight#. | #topic.news#. Drink one with me.

rule s83w_loss_devout
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss self.piety=devout
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. The Bright One keeps the lost. I tell myself that. | #topic.news#. I've prayed and prayed. | #topic.news#. #rest.capitalize#.

## ================================================================ Work: apprenticed, a master, carrying on another's work

rule s83w_work_1
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Good news for once. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. Things are changing. | You'll want to hear this. #topic.news#.

rule s83w_work_2
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. I'm still taking it in. | Big news, for me anyway. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. It's all new.

rule s83w_work_3
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Things are looking up. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. Wish me luck. | Here's a thing. #topic.news#.

rule s83w_work_apprentice
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work self.apprentice=yes
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#! I'm learning a proper trade. | #topic.news#. I'll be good at it, you watch. | #topic.news#. I start at dawn and finish when I'm told.

rule s83w_work_apprentice2
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work self.apprentice=yes
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. My paws are all blisters already. | #topic.news#. There's so much to learn. | #topic.news#. I sweep a lot. They say that's how it starts.

rule s83w_work_master
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work self.master=yes
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. Somebody to pass it on to, at last. | #topic.news#. I remember when I was the one sweeping. | #topic.news#. We'll see if there's a craftsman in there.

rule s83w_work_master2
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work self.master=yes
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. Keen, which is half of it. | #topic.news#. I'll be patient. Mostly. | #topic.news#. My own master would laugh to see it.

rule s83w_work_adolescent
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work self.stage=adolescent
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#! I'm practically grown. | #topic.news#. My elders are so proud it's embarrassing. | Guess what! #topic.news#.

rule s83w_work_poor
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. Things might get better now. | #topic.news#. I could cry. I did cry, a little. | #topic.news#. A way up, maybe.

rule s83w_work_friends
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work pair.band=friends|family|spouses
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say You first. #topic.news#. | I wanted you to know. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. Say you're proud of me.

rule s83w_work_strangers
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work pair.band=strangers|acquaintances
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Sorry, I'm telling everyone. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. I can't keep it in. | You don't know me, but #topic.news#.

rule s83w_work_old
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work self.stage=old
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. Not done yet, you see. | At my age! #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. They'll not be rid of me so easily.

rule s83w_work_tavern
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work here.place=tavern
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A cup to celebrate. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. I'll buy, this once. | Drink to it with me. #topic.news#.

rule s83w_work_mourning
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work self.mourning=kin|friend
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. It's not how I'd have wanted it. | #topic.news#. Somebody had to carry it on. | #topic.news#. I'll do it the way it was done.

## ================================================================ A crime done to the teller; a guard's arrest

rule s83w_crime_1
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=crime self.role!=guard
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say I have to tell someone. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. I'm still shaking. | You'll hear it anyway. #topic.news#.

rule s83w_crime_2
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=crime self.role!=guard
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. I've not been right since. | Bad week. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. I keep going over it.

rule s83w_crime_3
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=crime self.role!=guard
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. In this town, of all places. | #topic.news#. I feel such a fool. | #topic.news#. I don't feel safe anywhere now.

rule s83w_crime_robbed
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=crime self.robbed=yes self.role!=guard
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. My own things. | #topic.news#. I'd been putting that by for months. | #topic.news#. I've nothing left worth taking now.

rule s83w_crime_robbed2
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=crime self.robbed=yes self.role!=guard
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. I've barred the door twice since. | #topic.news#. I keep checking my pockets. | #topic.news#. I could spit.

rule s83w_crime_hurt
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=crime self.injured=light|bad self.role!=guard
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. Look at me. | #topic.news#. It still hurts to breathe. | #topic.news#. I'll mend. Slowly.

rule s83w_crime_friends
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=crime pair.band=friends|family|spouses self.role!=guard
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say I didn't want to frighten you. #topic.news#. | You're the first I've told. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. Can I stay at yours tonight?

rule s83w_crime_neighbours
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=crime pair.neighbours=yes self.role!=guard
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say Lock your door tonight. #topic.news#. | Right on our row. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. Did you hear anything?

rule s83w_crime_old
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=crime self.stage=old self.role!=guard
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. At my age. | #topic.news#. In all my years, never once. | #topic.news#. The town's not what it was.

rule s83w_crime_poor
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=crime self.wealth=poor|destitute self.role!=guard
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. As if I had anything to spare. | #topic.news#. They took what little there was. | #topic.news#. Robbing the poor. Who does that?

rule s83w_crime_merchant
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=crime self.role=merchant
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. Right at my own counter. | #topic.news#. I'll be locking the shutters at noon now. | #topic.news#. Bad for the shop, bad for me.

rule s83w_crime_guard
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=crime self.role=guard
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. Somebody had to. | Busy day. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. That's one less to worry about.

rule s83w_crime_guard2
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=crime self.role=guard
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. Came quietly, mostly. | #topic.news#. The magistrate can have it now. | #topic.news#. All in a day's work for the Watch.

## ================================================================ More ways in, by the moment and the trade

rule s83w_wed_spring
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage here.season=spring|summer
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say A wedding with the blossom out. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. Couldn't have picked a better season. | Warm days ahead. #topic.news#.

rule s83w_wed_winter
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage here.season=autumn|winter
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Something to keep us warm this winter. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. A cold season and a warm house. | #topic.news#. Two by the fire beats one.

rule s83w_wed_festival
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage world.festival=today|soon
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say We'll dance at the festival as a pair. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. Just in time for the festival. | Two reasons to celebrate. #topic.news#.

rule s83w_wed_neighbours
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage pair.neighbours=yes
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say You'll be seeing more of us. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. You'll hear us laughing through the wall. | Neighbour, you'll want to hear this. #topic.news#.

rule s83w_wed_street
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage here.place=street|gate|market
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say I'm stopping everyone I know. #topic.news#. | Wait, wait. #topic.news#. | I can't walk ten steps without telling someone. #topic.news#.

rule s83w_wed_comfortable
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage self.wealth=comfortable
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say We've a home and each other. What more is there? #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. A small wedding, but ours. | #topic.news#. We'll set up house properly now.

rule s83w_wed_guard
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage self.job=guard|soldier
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Off duty, and married. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. Somebody to come home to after the night watch. | #topic.news#. The barracks have been teasing me all week.

rule s83w_wed_merchant
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage self.role=merchant
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Good news from behind the counter. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. Two of us at the stall now. | #topic.news#. Best bargain I ever made.

rule s83w_wed_farmer
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage self.job=farmer|herder|fisher|sailor
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. Another pair of paws, and a good heart with them. | Between the work and the weather, I found time. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. The work goes easier for two.

rule s83w_wed_merry
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage self.humour=merry
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Ha! You'll never guess. #topic.news#! | #topic.news#. I know. I know! | Somebody actually said yes. #topic.news#.

rule s83w_loss_home
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss here.place=home
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. The house is full of little reminders. | You'll have noticed the shutters. #topic.news#. | Come in, sit. #topic.news#.

rule s83w_loss_street
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss here.place=street|gate|market
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say I had to get out of the house. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. Walking helps, a little. | Sorry. I'm not myself. #topic.news#.

rule s83w_loss_winter
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss here.season=winter
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say A hard winter, this one. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. The cold makes it worse somehow. | #topic.news#. I keep the fire high, and it doesn't help.

rule s83w_loss_night
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss here.time=night|dusk
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say The nights are the worst. #topic.news#. | I can't sleep. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. I didn't want to sit in the dark alone.

rule s83w_loss_poor
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. I couldn't even pay for flowers. | #topic.news#. Burying costs. I'll manage somehow. | #topic.news#. We had so little, and now less.

rule s83w_loss_neighbours
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss pair.neighbours=yes
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say You'll have heard, I expect. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. Thank you for the quiet these few days. | #topic.news#. You've been a good neighbour through it.

rule s83w_loss_farmer
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss self.job=farmer|herder|fisher|sailor
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. The work doesn't stop, though. It never does. | #topic.news#. I went out at dawn anyway. What else is there? | #topic.news#. The beasts still need feeding.

rule s83w_loss_merchant
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss self.role=merchant
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say I've shut the stall for a day. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. I can't look at the ledger. | #topic.news#. The customers have been kind.

rule s83w_loss_guard
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss self.job=guard|soldier
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. I stood my watch anyway. | #topic.news#. Work keeps my head straight. | #topic.news#. You learn to keep a straight face in the Watch. It doesn't help.

rule s83w_loss_healer
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss self.job=healer|priest
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say I've sat with so many. And now #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. All my remedies, and nothing to be done. | #topic.news#. I've said the words over so many. Now I'm the one who listens.

rule s83w_loss_quiet
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss self.talk=quiet
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. | Mm. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. That's all.

rule s83w_loss_old_kin
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss self.mourning=kin self.stage=old
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. It should have been me first. | #topic.news#. I've outlived too many of my own. | #topic.news#. The young shouldn't go before the old.

rule s83w_work_place
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work here.place=work
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Right here's where I'll be, from now on. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. First day, and look at me. | Have a look round. #topic.news#.

rule s83w_work_comfortable
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work self.wealth=comfortable
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. Steady, that's what I wanted. | #topic.news#. It's a good step. | #topic.news#. We'll be all right now.

rule s83w_work_dawn
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work here.time=dawn
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Up before the sun, and glad of it. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. Early starts from now on. | First light, and off I go. #topic.news#.

