when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work pair.neighbours=yes
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say You'll see me off early from now on. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. If I'm loud in the mornings, that's why. | #topic.news#. Thought the row should know.

rule s83w_work_smith
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work self.job=smith|crafter
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. There's a forge to keep hot, and a trade to pass on. | #topic.news#. Iron's patient. So am I. | #topic.news#. Good paws for it, I think.

rule s83w_work_food
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work self.job=baker|cook|brewer|innkeeper
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. Flour to the elbows already. | #topic.news#. There's an oven to learn, and its tempers. | #topic.news#. Come and taste what we make.

