when concept=talk.news topic.kind=work self.job=farmer|herder|fisher|woodcutter
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. Outdoors, all weathers. Suits me. | #topic.news#. The land's a hard teacher. | #topic.news#. I'll be up before the beasts.

