say #topic.news#. It's a start. Only a start. | #topic.news#. Give me a few years. | #topic.news#. I've plans, you'll see.

rule s83w_crime_home
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=crime here.place=home self.role!=guard
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say Right here, in my own home. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. I keep looking at the door. | #topic.news#. It doesn't feel like mine any more.

