when concept=talk.news topic.kind=crime here.time=night|dusk self.role!=guard
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say I hate the dark now. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. I'll not go out after dark for a while. | #topic.news#. Every shadow's somebody.

