rule s83w_crime_servant
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=crime self.job=servant|laborer|carter
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
say #topic.news#. As if I'd anything worth the trouble. | #topic.news#. Nobody listens to the likes of me. | #topic.news#. A day's pay, gone.

rule s83w_crime_young
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=crime self.stage=young|adolescent self.role!=guard
does tell.feeling
cooldown 1d
