## ================================================================ Any news, by the moment

rule s83w_any_1
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=marriage|work
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say I've news of my own. #topic.news#. | Here's my news. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. That's my week.

rule s83w_any_2
when concept=talk.news topic.kind!=loss|crime
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Something's happened. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. Well, what do you think of that? | #topic.news#. Life does surprise you.

rule s83w_any_spouses
when concept=talk.news pair.band=spouses topic.kind!=marriage
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
