rule s83w_any_rivals
when concept=talk.news pair.band=rivals
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Before you hear it wrong. #topic.news#. | You'll hear it anyway. #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. Make of it what you like.

## ================================================================ The answers (move lines, found by the move: any tell.news on the topic)

rule s83w_re_wed
does react.news.glad
when conv.topic=news topic.kind=marriage
say Oh, that's wonderful! | Congratulations! | About time! | I'm so glad for you. | #gladnews#!

rule s83w_re_wed2
does react.news.glad
when conv.topic=news topic.kind=marriage
say Many happy years to you both. | Bless you both. | Long life and good luck to you. | You'll be happy. I can see it.

rule s83w_re_wed_tease
does react.news.glad
when conv.topic=news topic.kind=marriage pair.band=friends
say I knew it! I said so! | You kept that quiet! | You never said a word! | Ha! Somebody finally caught you.

rule s83w_re_loss
does sympathise
when conv.topic=news topic.kind=loss
say I'm so sorry. | #sympathy.capitalize#. | #rest.capitalize#. | That's hard. I'm here. | Oh, I'm sorry. Truly.

rule s83w_re_loss2
does sympathise
when conv.topic=news topic.kind=loss
say Take all the time you need. | If you need anything, you know where I am. | Come and eat with us tonight. | Don't be alone tonight.

rule s83w_re_loss_old
does sympathise
when conv.topic=news topic.kind=loss self.stage=old
say It doesn't go. You learn to carry it. | I've buried many. It gets no easier. Only quieter. | Grief walks beside you. Let it.

rule s83w_re_work
does react.news.glad
when conv.topic=news topic.kind=work
say Well done! | That's grand. You'll do well. | Good for you. | #gladnews#. You've earned it.

rule s83w_re_work2
does react.news.glad
when conv.topic=news topic.kind=work
say Look at you. | That's a step up. | Proper work. Good. | I'm proud of you.

rule s83w_re_work_apprentice
does give.advice
when conv.topic=news topic.kind=work other.apprentice=yes
say Watch, listen, and sweep. That's how it starts. | Keep your mouth shut and your eyes open. You'll learn. | The first year's the hardest. Stick at it.

rule s83w_re_crime
does sympathise
when conv.topic=news topic.kind=crime other.role!=guard
say Gods. Are you all right? | #pity#. Sit down a moment. | I'm so sorry. | That's awful. In your own town.

rule s83w_re_crime2
does reassure
when conv.topic=news topic.kind=crime other.role!=guard
say You're safe now. That's what matters. | It wasn't your fault. None of it. | Things can be replaced. You can't. | We'll look after you.

rule s83w_re_crime_guard
does react.news
when conv.topic=news topic.kind=crime other.role=guard
say Good. Somebody had to. | One less on the streets. | Well done, then. | I'll sleep better for it.

rule s83w_re_crime_watch
does sympathise
when conv.topic=news topic.kind=crime other.role!=guard self.job=guard|soldier
say I'm sorry. Come by the watch-house and I'll take it down. | I'll ask about. Something will turn up. | That shouldn't happen to anyone. I'll look into it.

rule s83w_re_work_master
does give.advice
when conv.topic=news topic.kind=work other.master=yes
say Be patient. You were young once. | Show, don't shout. It sticks better. | A full belly learns faster. Feed your apprentice well.
